WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.702
CompTIA Network Plus, domain 3, Network operations, which is 19 percent of the exam.

00:00:07.702 --> 00:00:10.350
This lesson covers objective 3 point 1.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:14.627
Explain the purpose of organizational processes and procedures.

00:00:14.627 --> 00:00:18.700
Two milestones sound alike, and the exam likes to swap them.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:23.480
Picture a product's life as a timeline.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.350
It starts out in service.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.180
At end of life, the vendor stops selling it.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.060
Later comes end of support: no more security patches, and no more help.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.979
In the question, a vendor stops providing security patches for a router.

00:00:37.979 --> 00:00:40.650
That's the last milestone, end of support.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.802
When the question says the vendor no longer provides patches or help, the answer is end of support.

00:00:48.802 --> 00:00:52.376
End of life comes earlier, when the product stops being sold.

00:00:52.376 --> 00:00:54.310
That's objective three point one.
